Leave Ctrl+Alt+F9 unclaimed and avoid keyboard/mouse input during the run. No permission prompt or network is needed. Inspect JSON gaps, retained counts, all four idle windows and CPU behavior before adopting the baseline. Full method, table, definitions and limits: `docs/perf.md`.

